OL,3,CAntimalarial compound hailed as
OL,4,C'exciting step forward' in fight
OL,5,Cagainst disease
OL,7,FScientists have hailed a new
OL,8,Fantimalarial compound as "an exciting
OL,9,Fstep forward" in the worldwide fight
OL,10,Fagainst the disease.
OL,12,FThe compound was discovered by
OL,13,Fresearchers at the University of
OL,14,FDundee, who said it has the potential
OL,15,Fto simplify dosing regimens for the
OL,16,Ftreatment and prevention of the
OL,17,Fillness.
OL,26,@pD@ZOUqD@MO]
