PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786929478
OL,3,CAntimalarial compound hailed as
OL,4,C'exciting step forward' in fight
OL,5,Cagainst disease
OL,7,FMalaria is a life-threatening disease
OL,8,Fspread to humans by some types of
OL,9,Fmosquitoes, and is mostly found in
OL,10,Ftropical countries.
OL,12,FIn 2024, there were an estimated 282
OL,13,Fmillion cases of malaria and 610,000
OL,14,Fdeaths from the disease worldwide `
OL,15,Ffigures which have been rising in part
OL,16,Fdue to growing resistance to medicines
OL,17,Fused in malaria control.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786929478
OL,3,CAntimalarial compound hailed as
OL,4,C'exciting step forward' in fight
OL,5,Cagainst disease
OL,7,FThe new compound, which is named
OL,8,Fcabamiquine, is described as a "novel
OL,9,Fdrug-like molecule" that can be
OL,10,Fdelivered in a single dose.
OL,12,FAn early-stage clinical trial showed
OL,13,Fthat when administered together with a
OL,14,Fcommonly used antimalarial drug called
OL,15,Fpyronaridine, it is both effective and
OL,16,Fhas a favourable safety profile in
OL,17,Fadults and adolescents.
OL,26,@pD@`OUqD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786929478
OL,3,CAntimalarial compound hailed as
OL,4,C'exciting step forward' in fight
OL,5,Cagainst disease
OL,7,FThe team said this supports further
OL,8,Fdevelopment for this combination
OL,9,Ftherapy in larger trials and in
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FDr Beatriz Baragana, a member of the
OL,13,FDundee University team that discovered
OL,14,Fcabamiquine, said: "This is an
OL,15,Fexciting step forward for a compound
OL,16,Fwhich has great potential to simplify
OL,17,Fdosing regimens for malaria, a disease
OL,18,Fwhich causes hundreds of thousands of
OL,19,Fdeaths every year.
OL,26,@vD@TOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786929478
OL,3,CAntimalarial compound hailed as
OL,4,C'exciting step forward' in fight
OL,5,Cagainst disease
OL,7,F"All of the initial work that
OL,8,Fultimately resulted in the discovery
OL,9,Fof cabamiquine was performed here in
OL,10,FDundee, with support and funding from
OL,11,FMedicines for Malaria Venture (MMV).
OL,13,F"We are delighted to see how the
OL,14,Fcompound, when administered with
OL,15,Fpyronaridine, is progressing into a
OL,16,Fpotential malaria medicine, giving
OL,17,Fhope to the millions of people
OL,18,Faffected by malaria every year."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUzD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
