OL,3,CAntimalarial compound hailed as
OL,4,C'exciting step forward' in fight
OL,5,Cagainst disease
OL,7,FProfessor Ian Gilbert is head of the
OL,8,FUniversity of Dundee's drug discovery
OL,9,Funit, which made the breakthrough.
OL,11,FThe unit works with partners to
OL,12,Ftranslate world-class biology research
OL,13,Finto novel drug targets and candidate
OL,14,Fdrugs to address unmet medical needs.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786929478
OL,3,CAntimalarial compound hailed as
OL,4,C'exciting step forward' in fight
OL,5,Cagainst disease
OL,7,FProf Gilbert said: "The benefits of
OL,8,Fthis compound are not only that it
OL,9,Flooks to be effective, with a good
OL,10,Fbenefit/risk profile, but it can also
OL,11,Fbe delivered in a single dose, which
OL,12,Fis an important factor when you are
OL,13,Ftreating a disease that occurs
OL,14,Fcommonly in areas where consistent
OL,15,Fdelivery of healthcare can be
OL,16,Fchallenging."
OL,26,@oD@TOUxD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
