OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786929478
OL,3,CAntimalarial compound hailed as
OL,4,C'exciting step forward' in fight
OL,5,Cagainst disease
OL,7,FThe team received financial and
OL,8,Fscientific support from MMV, which now
OL,9,Fintends to take cabamiquine-
OL,10,Fpyronaridine forward for further
OL,11,Fdevelopment.
OL,13,FPaul Willis, vice president of drug
OL,14,Fdiscovery and preclinical safety at
OL,15,FMMV, said: "Novel treatment and
OL,16,Fprevention regimens are urgently
OL,17,Fneeded with simplified dosing to
OL,18,Fenable effective case management and
OL,19,Fto support long-term malaria control
OL,20,Fand elimination goals."
OL,26,@wD@LOU|D@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
