PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786929478
OL,3,CAntimalarial compound hailed as
OL,4,C'exciting step forward' in fight
OL,5,Cagainst disease
OL,7,FThe results of the study have been
OL,8,Fpublished in The Lancet Infectious
OL,9,FDiseases.
OL,11,FThe trial was conducted by the
OL,12,Fpharmaceutical company Merck, as part
OL,13,Fof the PAMAfrica consortium, and was
OL,14,Fco-funded by the EDCTP2 Programme,
OL,15,Fsupported by the European Union and
OL,16,Fthe Swedish International Development
OL,17,FCo-operation Agency.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
